    {
      "id": "section:2/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "A `prev_state=R` means the task was preempted (involuntary switch). `prev_state=S` means it voluntarily gave up the CPU.",
      "source_hash": 13691391055135479029,
      "context_hash": 13169385772628798520,
      "translation": "`prev_state=R`은 태스크가 선점되었음(비자발적 스위치)을 의미합니다. `prev_state=S`는 태스크가 자발적으로 CPU를 양보했음을 의미합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "CPU": "CPU"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:55:18.534564Z",
      "issues": []
    },
