    {
      "id": "section:4/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "High \"Maximum delay\" for a task means it was occasionally stuck waiting for the CPU for a long time.",
      "source_hash": 8361526486841509909,
      "context_hash": 14315312086100534447,
      "translation": "어떤 태스크의 \"Maximum delay\"가 높다면 그 태스크가 이따금 CPU를 오랫동안 기다리며 멈춰 있었다는 뜻입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
